From: bezko <bezkom@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 05:06:18 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Expose strip stereo pan width (Shift+drag pan).
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Equal-Power stereo tracks get pan_width_control (−1..+1); W badge + width band.
--smoke-pan-width: temp stereo full→0→full (Dummy exit 0).
